            "title": "<p><strong>STEP 2: </strong>Eye Serum</p>",
            "description": "<p><strong>HOW: </strong>Gently tap <strong>one drop </strong>of product from the inner corner along the under-eye & up to the brow bone. Repeat for the other eye.<br/><br/><strong>WHERE: </strong>Swipe once under the eye, then above the brow, & apply the remaining serum on the eyelid for all-around care.<br/><br/><strong>WHEN: </strong>AM and/or PM</p>"
