            "title": "<p><strong>STEP 4: </strong>Bio-Retinol Cream</p>",
            "description": "<p><strong>HOW: </strong>Warm up one pump of the cream between your fingertips and massage it in using light pressure.<br/><br/><strong>WHERE: </strong>Face & Neck<br/><br/><strong>WHEN: </strong>AM and PM</p>"
          }
