    "unico-landing-how-works-import": {
      "type": "unico-landing-how-works",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "title": "Why You Need This",
        "description": "The Odyssey Trunk is your ultimate skincare companion, thoughtfully curated to deliver top-to-toe care with maximum benefits. \n<br><br>\n<b>New year, fresh look, same beloved products!</b><br>\nAs we step into 2025, we’re leveling up & taking you along on the journey. With the Odyssey Trunk, be among the first to experience our refreshed look! \n<br><br>\n<b>Everything You Need, Anywhere You Go</b><br>\nCrafted to suit all skin moods, you can cleanse with the Melting Balm Cleanser, hydrate and brighten with the Eye Serum, nourish your face with the Radiance Face Oil, and the body with the Vitamin C Body Oil.\n<br><br>\n<b>Ready. Set. Glow.</b><br>\nWith the Aminu Passport to help you understand your products & double as a travel checklist, and the Glow-Trotter luggage tag, you will be prepared, no matter where life takes you.",
        "more_text": "",
        "video_poster_image": "shopify://shop_images/cover_picture_trunk_5a075d66-333b-4d84-aeda-7b7c38037857.jpg",
        "video_url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/d679171f9f534eaca12e1adbaaa50e0c.mp4"
      }
    },
    "unico-landing-easy-to-use-import": {
      "type": "unico-landing-easy-to-use",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Super Easy to Use",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/5_Odyssey_Trunk.jpg",
        "how": "<p><strong>WHEN:</strong> AM & PM, depending on your skin's mood & needs<br/><br/><strong>ORDER OF APPLICATION</strong> </p><p>Cleanse -&gt; Apply Eye Serum -&gt; Radiance Face Oil -&gt; Vit C Body Oil<br/><br/>For detailed instructions on how to use the cleanser, <a href=\"https://www.aminu.life/products/melting-balm-cleanser\" target=\"_blank\">click below:</a> </p>",
        "where": "",
        "when": "",
        "hiddenText": "<p><strong>PRO-TIP:</strong> </p><p>When using the Melting Balm Cleanser, don’t forget to massage the cleansing balm near your hairline and along your jawline, as these are often-overlooked areas.</p><p>The Eye Serum can be used under eye makeup to keep skin hydrated & prevent creasing/ caking & the Radiance Face Oil can function as a primer too. </p><p>Apply the Vit C Body Oil before shaving for a smooth glide and a closer shave!</p>",
